OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leaders wary of radical
OL,4,Aplan to redraw Scotland's local
OL,5,Agovernment map
OL,6,
OL,7,FCouncil leaders have been voicing their
OL,8,Fconcerns about proposals for the
OL,9,Fbiggest shake up of local government in
OL,10,F30 years.
OL,12,FSome have warned that Scottish
OL,13,Fgovernment plans to potentially
OL,14,Fstreamline the number of authorities
OL,15,Ffrom 32 to six will not save money.
OL,17,FOthers have questioned the potential
OL,18,Fimpact on rural parts and the "absurd"
OL,19,Ftimeline.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
